WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.793
One paper, please.

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:05.797
"Hot prince visit makes 
temperatures rise in the city."

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.924
Seriously, though, 
what's with his hair?

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:11.761
I just got a call to do

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.680
the hair and makeup
 for the royal wedding...

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:16.683
...for $50,000.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.769
-It's like a glass slipper.
-But money.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.606
There's the castle!

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:26.985
Welcome to Lavania.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:33.533
-May I introduce Prince Thomas.
-I'm Izzy of 183rd Street.

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:36.661
You're young and in love.

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:39.289
-Come on, you two.
-I hardly know Lauren.

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.875
-This is nothing but 
an arranged marriage.

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:45.587
-What are you doing here?
-I was hoping I could join you.

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.671
-Thomas.
-Hm?

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.593
You could be my Sherpa guide
to normal life.

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:53.261
A town car's trailing us.

00:00:53.344 --> 00:00:55.597
-One, two, three, stop!

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:58.433
-What happens if we run?
-Let's find out.

00:00:59.017 --> 00:00:59.976
Go, go!

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.273
-So why are you just a hairdresser?
-"Just"?

00:01:06.775 --> 00:01:10.779
Truth is, I'd love nothing more
than to do something else.

00:01:10.862 --> 00:01:12.906
-Scissors ready!
-One, two, three.

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:14.157
Yes, two, three.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.868
We're in hair camp
and you're out flirting with hot royalty.

00:01:16.951 --> 00:01:18.620
I'm not flirting with Prince Thomas.

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:20.330
You gave me the look.

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.748
-What look?
-This look.

00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:27.045
Are you ready to have 
your mind blown?

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:28.880
-Woo!

00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:30.757
-Find Thomas and 
bring him immediately.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.218
Please. I don't want you to go.

